{
  "about": "The patch editor's routing on the Demo show (dark): the default routing, cue output 1 sent to both device outputs at -6 and -12 dB by typing in the boxes, the typing box open, then the Device Outputs tab with device output 2 lowered and muted, the matrix marking it muted, Unmute All, and the copy pull-down set back to the defaults.",
  "show": "Demo",
